window.products.push({"id":761175,"name":"Vacuum Sealer Bags Rolls - 4 Pack (Width 6’’/8’’/10’’/11’’, Length 16.5’) for Food Saver, Seal a Meal Vac Sealers, Heavy Duty Sous Vide Storage Bags, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jf+tkQcpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"DMORED has more than 10 years experience of producing professional food storage bags and with US quality standards! DMORED food sealer roll bags can be microwaved, frozen, re-used, washed, boiled and dishwasher safe. Allows you to precisely control your cooking temperature to achieve perfect results.You can cook sous vide in DMORED bags by placing them in water at any temperature up to 195°F/90°C. Our food saver bags have specially designed channels that remove oxygen, keeping your food's moisture and creating an airtight barrier that locks in flavor and prevents spoilage and freezer burn. Vacuum Sealer Bags Rolls Specifications - 3.5 mil thick non-embossed front panel for optimum clarity- Constructed of food grade material to block moisture and oxygen- Easy-to-use and economical for sealing items of different sizes and lengths- 4 mil thick embossed back panel with dot air channel design for maximum oxygen removal- Universal designed embossed panel for maximum air removal on all major brand vacuum sealers Key Features of Vacuum food storage bags rolls COOK-SAFE DMORED bags and rolls are made to cook sous vide, boil to reheat, or used in the microwave to reheat or steam when the bag is punctured. FREEZER-SAFE Our bags are designed to completely withdraw oxygen from the bag, keeping your food's moisture and flavor in and prevent oxygen from seeping back in, avoiding freezer burn. BPA FREE We pledge to keep your food safe and are committed to making food-safe bags that are free of BPA, phthalates and other plasticizers. UNIVERSAL DMORED vacuum sealer bags and rolls fit inside all major brand vacuum sealers including Food Saver, Weston, Cabela's, Seal-a-Meal, Ziploc & more Packing included 4 x Vacuum Sealer Bags Rolls ( 6in x 16.5ft/8in x 16.5ft/10in x 16.5ft/11in x 16.5ft )10 x Adhesive ABS Hooks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jf+tkQcpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DMORED","source_asin":"B088C38M4W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-761175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088C38M4W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088C38M4W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
