window.products.push({"id":761184,"name":"GMISUN Olive Oil Spout, 4 Pack Stainless Steel Bottle Pourers with Automatic Flip-Top Dust Caps, Speed Drink Pourer Spouts for Pours Olive Oil, Liquor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SseoUaf0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Fit for Drip-Free liquid Spout: The rubber stopper of oil spout is made of food grade rubber with good sealing effect and prevents erosion, it’s durable and can fit snugly on the bottle, so don't worry about liquid leaking from the side. You can get the best experience by using our liquor bottle pourers. Flow Consistent Oil Spout: Our oil pourer is designed with an angled tapered, when you use our olive oil spout, keeps liquid out very consistent stream and can easily pour at a good speed, and you will minimize liquid spills or drips, perfectly control the flow you need, so you can pour just the right amount of oil onto your salad. Anti-Deterioration Material & Easy to Clean: The bottle pour spout part is made of 18/8-304 stainless steel, it is corrosion -resistant, durable, and can be used repeatedly. It is important that the oil dispenser spout does not deteriorate for a long time to produce odor to ensure that the liquid is clean. Easy to clean, Simply soak in soapy water to perfectly clean the dirt from the oil bottle spout by hand. Multipurpose Pour Spout: The bottle pour spout suitable for (0.75-0.9 inch Caliber) common round bottles, widely used in bars, clubs, restaurants, cafes, and home kitchens, try it out on bottles of olive oil, vinegar, coffee, syrups, and other liquids you like. It will offer the same great benefits. Our oil bottle spout is the best choice for you. Automatic Cap & Dust-Proof: Unlike the silicone cap, when pouring liquid, the olive oil dispenser spout cap will automatically open or close, don't worry about losing it. No more manually unscrewing the cap and touching the oil pourer spout to get sticky grease on your hands. And is nice for keeping additional air and impurities from getting into the bottle during storage, make sure the oil, vinegar, and syrup in the bottle are clean and extend the shelf life of the food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SseoUaf0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GM GMISUN","source_asin":"B09SZ61T8Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-761184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SZ61T8Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SZ61T8Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
