window.products.push({"id":761300,"name":"Silicone Kitchen Cooking Utensils Set with Holder, Deedro Kitchen Utensils 18 Pcs Non-stick Silicone Cooking Utensils Spatula Set, Heat Resistant Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ngN+REtfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍄【DURABLE ANTI-SCALDING WOODEN HANDLE】Silicone cookware set is ergonomically designed for comfortable grip, fits nicely into your hand, well crafted and non corrosive. Solid wooden cookware handles gives a vintage feel and prevents heat transfer, it won’t become too hot to touch if the utensil is leaving in the pot while cooking, so you don’t have to worry about scalding your hands. Add stainless steel core to enhance durability and toughness to keep the spatulas from bending or breaking. 🍄【HIGH HEAT RESISTANT & NO STAINS】The cooking utensil set can withstand very high heat, up to 446℉/230℃, even if they are used under high temperature condition of frying. The high heat tolerance of the silicone heads prevents the utensil from melting when exposed to heat. Will not retain smells or colors when you use it for mixing or stirring deep-colored food. These are great gadgets to extend the life of all your kitchen pans. 🍄【HEALTHY SOFT FOOD GRADE SILICONE, ODORLESS】All the silicone kitchen utensils are made of food-grade silicone, BPA free, which is safe to use for any type of food, keeping our health safe from harmful toxins and chemicals. This silicone kitchen utensil set does not react with food or beverages, or produce any noxious odors at high temperatures. Soft silicone won't scratch your nonstick cookware, will not scrape or scratch any pots or pans like metals do. 🍄【EASY TO CLEAN & STORAGE】The nonstick silicone heads make it easy to clean by hand in warm soapy water, simply wipe under hot water. We recommend only hand washing. Each one has a utility hole on the handle for easy hanging, help you store all your kitchen gadgets conveniently and keep tidy. Also come with a complimentary storage bucket that helps you save space in your drawers while keeping your utensils within easy reach. There are holes in the bottom of the holder to keep the utensils dry. 🍄【COMPLETELY MEET THE NEEDS OF KITCHEN】The variety of these 18 pieces of kitchen tools ensure you have exactly what is needed at hand for the perfect meal every time. Grill, mix ingredients, stir sauces, whip cream, flip eggs or pancakes, pan fry or stir fry as much as you wish. Food grade silicone combine with smooth wooden handle ensures daily use for a long time without being worn down. This kitchenware set is great gift for party, wedding, housewarming, festival and other special occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ngN+REtfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deedro","source_asin":"B093C44KLK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-761300","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093C44KLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093C44KLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
