window.products.push({"id":761540,"name":"EULANGDE Thickened Upgraded 304 Stainless Steel Meat Cutter Manual Frozen Meat Slicer Beef Mutton Roll Food Slicer Slicing Machine for Home Cooking of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QMw7BSeVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"1.This multi-functional meat cutter is very convenient for slicing food, It is suitable for frozen beef, mutton, chicken, luncheon meat, and ham. It is also suitable for cutting some vegetables and fruits (potatoes, lotus roots, carrots).To avoid damaged blade, please DO NOT SLICE BON-IN MEAT. 2.Slice thickness 0.8-1.0mm. Adjustable thickness: Support button adjustment, rotate the button, adjust the thinness clockwise, and adjust the thickness counterclockwise. 3. Cut from Thickened 304 stainless steel , waterproof and rust-resistant, Smooth stainless steel surface is easy to clean and hygienic,wash and dry all parts immediately after use. Use a paper towel or a hair dryer to clean the surface, and regularly oil the bearings to keep it in good working condition. 4.Spring-assisted meat rolls: As the spring recovers and deforms, the meat enters the cutting range of the blade. You don't need to push with your hands, which can effectively protect the hands. Strong sucker: With a strong vacuum sucker footpad, the slicer can be fixed on the desktop firmly without moving.【Note: Tear off the protective film before use，There might be slight scratches on the product, it happened during transportation, please rest assured the product is new】 5. Package includes: a set of the frozen meat slicer, a separate spring, 2 blades(1 installed， the other is pasted on the bottom of the machine), 10 meat bags,2 suction cups, an allen wrench and the instruction manual.【 NOTE: Please read the instruction manual and properly freeze the meat before using this product. There are detailed steps showing you how to prepare the ingredient and how to operate this product. If the meat is not properly frozen, it would be difficult to achieve a clean cut. 】","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QMw7BSeVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EULANGDE","source_asin":"B0BZ3X5ZVC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-761540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ3X5ZVC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ3X5ZVC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
