window.products.push({"id":761607,"name":"GOXIFACA Handheld Vacuum Cordless 8000PA, Vacuum Cleaner, Strong Suction, Multipurpose Hand Vacuum, 3-Layer Filtration, Portable & Rechargeable Vacuum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-Rk1xECXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【120W Motor and 8000Pa Suction Power】Our portable small vacuum cleaner is simple in design, but not simple in function. We have a 120W super rated power motor and a really strong suction power of 8000Pa. The suction power is long-lasting and does not attenuation, does not heat up, and effectively, quickly and thoroughly absorbs stubborn dust, pet hair and debris. 【Wireless Lightweight Design & Low Noise】Are you still annoyed that the vacuum cleaner cord is not long enough to clean the whole room? Choose us for a handheld cordless vacuum cleaner that is beautiful and compact for easy portability and storage. No need to worry about bulky or tangled wires and say goodbye to finding outlets. Move and clean as much as you want. Ergonomic handle design, one-handed operation is comfortable and easy to clean. During use, the noise is ≤60dB, which will not affect the rest of the family. 【Deep and Comprehensive Cleaning】Our handheld vacuum cleaner is equipped with four multi-functional cleaning accessories, which support all-round cleaning of the house. It can meet various usage requirements and scenarios. The crevice nozzle is designed to clean tight, hard-to-reach places such as sofa crevices, car seat crevices. A brush nozzle is recommended when cleaning pet hair from car air vents and carpets. The wide mouth nozzle can be used for large particles of debris, etc. The extension hose can clean deep and narrow corners, such as the bottom of the bed, etc., and can also be installed with the crevice nozzle. 【Quick Charge and Long Run】Portable Handheld Vacuum Cordless Rechargeable with 2000mAh large capacity battery, it only takes 3.5-4 hours to complete the charge. Ours provide temperature/short circuit/overvoltage/overcurrent/overcharge protection to ensure device safety. After being fully charged, it supports cleaning for 18-25 minutes, and the high-intensity suction will not decay. 【Washable and Removable HEPA Filter】This mini handheld vacuum cleaner features advanced design and enhanced HEPA filter. We come with a 350ML dust cup, and the simple design of \"one twist and one fall\" allows you to easily empty the dust cup. HEPA filter can effectively filter dust and fine particles to avoid secondary pollution. Regular cleaning of the washable filter prevents loss of suction and clogging, maintains good suction and lasts longer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-Rk1xECXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOXIFACA","source_asin":"B0BZVD81HD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-761607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZVD81HD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZVD81HD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
