window.products.push({"id":761712,"name":"Fitted Tablecloth (Fits 6 feet center folding tables, spicing up any party)) Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9159k3YnW2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inspired by beautiful unique Hawaiian flora and sea animals, a Hawaii-based artist designed these tablecloth to create an inviting picnic party full of ALOHA. (The traditional Hawaiian greeting means more than just hello and goodbye. It represents a spirit of harmony, affection and mutual respect.) Buy these tablecloth and bring freshness, tropical warm and style to your party. Perfect for your picnic table. Great for spicing up any party, like graduation party. Good quality. The size fits 6 feet picnic tables (size 72\" x 30\"). If you like a table cloth fitting 4 feet picnic table, please contact me. we have them. 100% polyester fabric, water resist coating and machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9159k3YnW2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kauhale Living","source_asin":"B072KWYDFR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-761712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072KWYDFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072KWYDFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
