window.products.push({"id":761714,"name":"Natural Action Technologies Blue Portable Structured Water Unit. Produces energized, structured water. Results in improved hydration. Increases the am","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710AN+DDSaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One time purchase replaces a lifetime of costly and wasteful water filters. This portable unit is easy to clean, maintenance free, and does not have any filters to replace. Take this unit to work, out to eat, and when traveling. Water flows through this portable unit in ever accelerating vortices, producing structured water for you to drink wherever you are. Structured water is energetic, living water that is more absorbable, optimizing hydration and flushing out toxins. Enjoy the benefits of a pure mountain spring right in your own hand. Quench your thirst, hydrate, and allow your body to heal from within. It comes with a peace of mind 90 day satisfaction guarantee AND a 10 year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710AN+DDSaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Natural Action","source_asin":"B01DZ744YM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-761714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DZ744YM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DZ744YM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":761715,"name":"Curious Chef Children's 3-Piece Nylon Knife Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t6FKcO0yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PLAYFUL DESIGNS, REAL TOOLS - This knife set is designed to spark the imagination of young children with its playful designs and bright colors while providing real-world tools for kids to cook with. Each piece has been tested and approved by children for ease of use, making it a safe and effective tool. The knives are ergonomically designed with smaller dimensions and safety features to allow children to confidently participate in food preparation, while keeping them safe. KID-FRIENDLY DESIGN - This Nylon serrated blade is the ideal tool for young aspiring chefs. The serrated edge allows it to easily cut through tough fruits and vegetables, while the blunt tip ensures safety when cutting near skin. The ergonomic handle and soft button grip provide a comfortable and secure hold for your child, allowing them to confidently and safely prepare meals. The durable nylon construction ensures that this blade will stand up to repeated use and is easy to clean. INCLUDES - The set includes a large knife, medium knife, and small knife, providing all the necessary tools for your little chef to help with cutting tasks in the kitchen. The knives are made with a construction that keeps hands and fingers safe while allowing children to be involved in food preparation. Whether it's slicing fruits, vegetables or breads, this set will make your child feel like a pro in the kitchen. What a fun way to teach your kids about cooking skills. DIMENSIONS - This 3-piece knife set includes a large knife (10.8\" L x 2\" W x 0.5\" H), medium knife (9.8\" L x 1.8\" W x 0.5\" H), and small knife (8.8\" L x 1.5\" W x 0.5\" H) designed specifically for children ages 4 and up. Perfectly sized for small hands, these knives promote safety and ease of use while encouraging culinary creativity. Made with durable materials and is easy to clean. Let your little chef help with the cutting while keeping hands and fingers safe with this versatile knife set. THE CURIOUS CHEF DIFFERENCE - Our kid-friendly kitchen tools are designed to provide real utensils and cooking tools for children aged 4 years old and above to express their creativity in the kitchen. We have put years of testing and research into each product to ensure both functionality and safety. Our Montessori inspired tools are designed to develop kids’ cooking skills and allow them to participate in food preparation while keeping them safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t6FKcO0yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Curious Chef","source_asin":"B002Q5YH9C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-761715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002Q5YH9C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002Q5YH9C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
