window.products.push({"id":761719,"name":"Welhome Premium Relaxed Linen Cotton Duvet Cover 3-Piece Sets with Pillow Shams | Full/Queen | Navy Blue | 88\"x 92\" | Supersoft | Superior Comfort | D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GMWT0uVhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY STYLISH DESIGN as you can choose from a range of color options for versatility or fashionable pops of color. Designed for everyday use, all seasons and to compliment any existing decor. The linen and cotton will add a look of soft luxury to your home while the surface allows for a relaxed feel of inviting texture. Pair or gift with the Relax Quilt and 230TC Washed Solid Organic Cotton Sheet Set by Welhome to complete the look. Each sold separately. SLEEP WELL with natural comfort that includes a 100% Linen face and 100% Cotton Reverse. Our duvet uses the aid of linen for anti-static, moisture-wicking properties, helping wick away and absorb moisture that naturally falls away during sleep. Woven into a 300 thread-count percale weave that delivers a crisp-and cool, yet soft to the touch-durability. Linen is not only luxuriously soft but uses less water during production making it a sustainable, earth-friendly fiber. MUST HAVE FEATURES to update a space into a sleep sanctuary. This duvet cover provides an inviting lightweight texture with clean corners for a fresh look. This duvet cover was garment washed for softness and remains durable while getting even softer over time as well. Pillow shams include center overlap closure to secure pillow fill. Duvet cover features button closures for easy opening and closing. Four twill ties inside duvet cover to help keep insert in place. QUALITY MATERIAL AND EASY CARE, standard machine washable, soft and breathable, lightweight cotton perfectly paired with linen. Machine wash cold, normal cycle. Wash dark colors separately, do not bleach. Tumble dry low. Medium iron only. Do not dry clean. Full/Queen Set Includes: 1 Duvet Cover (88in x 92in) 2 Standard Shams (20in x 26in). King/Cal-King Set Includes: 1 Duvet Cover (108in x 92in) 2 King Shams (20in x 36in). (Duvet insert not included) DESIGNED WITH CARE, our packaging is made using sustainable PEVA, a less toxic alternative to vinyl that can cause a cloudiness in its overall color structure and is chlorine and phthalate-free. Our products are made using environmentally sustainable farming practices and water saving technologies. We care about the environment and guarantee our manufacturing is leading the way to a better tomorrow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GMWT0uVhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Welhome","source_asin":"B07W7T8SWK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-761719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W7T8SWK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W7T8SWK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":761720,"name":"Town & Country Living Buffalo Check Fabric Tablecloth, 70\", Red & White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XRjtw967L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create the perfect table setting with the Buffalo Check tablecloth by SoHome. The trendy and charming buffalo check pattern makes the perfect backdrop for your dinnerware and will also complement your modern farmhouse décor. Made with a cotton-rich, heavyweight fabric that is water repellent, stain resistant and fade resistant. This table cover is perfect for festive brunches, everyday meals, holiday parties and formal dinners. Available in a variety of sizes and colors to best suit your décor needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XRjtw967L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Town & Country Living","source_asin":"B08KFMR8PL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-761720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KFMR8PL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KFMR8PL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
