window.products.push({"id":761861,"name":"MENGNAN White Daisy String Lights 10ft 40LEDs Copper Wire with The Remote &Timer for Patio, Terrace, Birthday, Covered Outdoor, Seasonal Themed Partie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BZTqo112L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"😊MENGNEN 40lights battery operated string lights are perfect for use toany decorative project. Newly design battery box (No more screws!!!)with locking clips is waterproof and very easy to hide perfect for  decoration indoor and outdoor.  😊 Color: white 😊 Size:10 ft 40 lights White Daisy sequins Size：0.6×0.6in  😊 Material: copper, acrylic LED  😊 Timer function (3×AA batteries required but not included)  😊 Lamp series of IP65 waterproof grade, a battery pack waterproof grade IP44 😊 For indoor/covered outdoor use:  😊 The string light is waterproof and designed to withstand light rain or water spills.  😊 21 Buttons Versatile Remote  Remote Function  ON/OFF: turn on or off the lights  Auto Timer: 2H/ 6H  SPEED+: speed up / SPPED-: speed down  Flicker Modes:  mode 1-- Always bright  mode 2-- Normally bright +Twinkle  mode 3-- Normally bright +breathing  mode 4-- Breathing  mode 5-- Alternating breathing  mode 6-- Breathing + Twinkle  mode 7-- Twinkle mode 8-- Alternating star flash  mode 9 -- Star flash mode + breathing  mode ※-- Star flash  mode 0-- Alternating star flash  mode # --Random  mode AUTO --Total 11 modes cycling😊 You can choose flicker mode and control the intensity of light,rang of remote control is around 5 meters.😊 10ft wire and 40LEDs, Battery-operated, requires 3 AA batteries(not included), remote capable(remote included), 3 AA batteries couldlast approximately 30 Hrs.🔺Warm tips: DO NOT soak the battery box in water❗❗❗😊 Thank you for your support for our store,If any problems encountered  in the use of this product, please contact us.😊MENGNAN and all the staff sincerely service for you and wish you a life, everything is smooth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BZTqo112L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MENGNAN THCT","source_asin":"B07XS97YR3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-761861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XS97YR3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XS97YR3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":761862,"name":"IMC Cambridge Electric Candle w/Bracket Steady Lighting- Antique Bronze (Qty 4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51N7JUOgSvS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Many new windows today are being made without window sills, so how do you put a candle in that window? Answer: IMC’s Cambridge Electric Candle with bracket! The tradition of burning a candle in the window is a sign of welcome. What better way to welcome your family and guests to your home than with IMC’s beautiful Cambridge Electric Steady-Lighted, Antique Bronze Window Candle (with bracket) glowing in your windows? It is designed for narrow or no window sills or replacement windows, it sets your candle perfectly in the window. To mount: open window one inch, place candle in window opening. Close the window to lock the bracket in place. It’s that easy! The Cambridge Electric Candle is equipped with a cool burning, steady lighted, electric incandescent bulb, making the candles the brightest and most beautiful candles in the industry today. Turning it on is as easy as plugging it in and using the rotary light switch to turn on/off. This model is a steady light candle that keeps a consistent warm, welcoming glow. Decorating you home for the holiday just became much easier! Easy set up and easy removal at the end of the season!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51N7JUOgSvS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IMC","source_asin":"B094PV7C64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-761862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094PV7C64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094PV7C64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":761863,"name":"Window Toppers Cherry Blossoms Print Ruffle Priscilla Curtains Pair 86-Inch-by-72-Inch - 3 Inch Rod Pocket, Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EGP88ZLWL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our Cherry Blossoms print ruffled priscilla window curtains are made from a 70% polyester / 30% cotton fabric featuring a unique design of cherries and cherry blossoms. These Ruffled Priscilla Curtains can be ordered in a choice of natural or black color patterns with a choice of either 1 1/2 inch or 3 inch rod pockets. (Product is pictured with 3 inch Rod Pocket). Select from 45, 54, 63, 72 & 84 inch lengths. These delightful country ruffled priscilla curtains with cherry blossoms print are adorned with 5 1/2 inch wide ruffles for an attractive appearance. One 86 inch wide pair of Cherry Blossoms print ruffled priscilla curtains will accommodate approximately 30 - 45 inches of window width. Length measurement - if ordered with a 1 1/2 inch rod pocket is measured Overall, from the top edge of the curtain to the bottom edge/longest point of the curtain. If ordered with a 3 inch rod pocket is measured from the top stitch line of the rod pocket to the bottom edge/longest point of the curtain. Width is measured Overall, 86 inch wide per pair including ruffle for both pieces together. Fabric is machine washable. Sold as a pair, 2 pieces with matching bow tiebacks. Rod Pockets - 1 1/2 inch rod pocket will require the use of one standard size curtain rod while 3 inch rod pocket will require the use of a 2 1/2 inch continental curtain rod. *Coordinating Ruffled Shaped Valances are available as well as 3 Piece Swags & Valance Sets, which are sold separately in our Amazon storefront. Cherry Blossoms Print Ruffle Shaped Valance (sold separately) is pictured with priscillas below main image. Made in the USA !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EGP88ZLWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Window Toppers","source_asin":"B005K8OJFE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-761863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005K8OJFE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005K8OJFE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":761864,"name":"Round Fitted Tablecloth with Elastic Edge Design Table Cover Wipeable Waterproof - Strawberry - Fits 36\" - 40\" Tables","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nXhmnWkmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MATERIAL: Water repellent polyester fabric which is super soft, smooth and wrinkle resistant.One piece seamless design and elegant hemmed edges make the circular table linens more durable. PERFECT FIT: The elastic edges make the polyester tablecloth fit tightly without moving/falling off. The S size is suitable for 36-40in round tables, The M is suitable for 41-46in round tables. FEATURE: Washable, reusable, lightweight, durable, wipeable, convenience. OCCASIONS: This round table cover is perfect for everyday use, party, holidays, catering, cafes, dinners, brunches, potlucks, BBQ's, buffets, indoor and outdoor patio use and more. EASY TO CARE: Easy to wipe off any spilled coffee, juice or wine on the reusable table clothes. Machine washable, do not bleach, no ironing required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nXhmnWkmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"onismico","source_asin":"B0B3XLNLV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-761864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3XLNLV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3XLNLV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
